<title>USA: TABLE - Sunrise Resources Inc Q1 net off.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Sunrise Resources Inc Q1 net off.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN VALLEY, Minn. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months</p>
<p>						 Ended June 30</p>
<p>					   1997		1996</p>
<p>    Revenues			$11,125,000    $10,670,000</p>
<p>    Cost of sales and expenses  9,441,000	8,569,000</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>     provision of income taxes  1,684,000	2,101,000</p>
<p>    Provision for income taxes    807,000	1,008,000</p>
<p>    Net income			 $877,000     $1,093,000</p>
<p>Net income per common share</p>
<p>     and common equivalent shares    $.12	     $.15</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>     shares outstanding     7,291,000 (a)	 7,189,000</p>
<p>(a)  Does include 599,075 shares awarded to former ILC shareholders in arbitration action brought by such shareholders arising out of the February 1995 merger of the Company with the P.J. King Companies Inc (d/b/a International Leasing Corporation).</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
